true%2C%22deleted%22%3Afalse%2C%22base_ref%22%3A%22refs%2Fheads%2F4.x%22%2C%22compare%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FFivePaths%2Fsatisfy%2Fcompare%2Fwebhook-fixture%22%2C%22commits%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22head_commit%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%2242d149814473826fd8087de5c0ad8b770a8654f2%22%2C%22tree_id%22%3A%227c6c51bb8dc6ff28477ab3ef1ae44be60b0671c2%22%2C%22distinct%22%3Atrue%2C%22message%22%3A%22Webhooks%3A+GitHub%2C+Gitea%2C+Bitbucket+and+Azure+DevOps+checked+against+their+documented+deliveries%3B+upgrade+notes+finished%5Cn%5CnGitHub+and+Gitea+no+longer+stream+%5C%22OK%5C%22+and+build+in+place%3A+they+answer+202+queued+through+the+same+path+as+the+others%2C+so+plugins+see+their+deliveries.+GitHub%27s+ping+is+answered+without+a+lookup%2C+form-encoded+deliveries+are+accepted%2C+and+auto-add+takes+the+HTTPS+clone+URL+rather+than+git%3A%2F%2F.+Signatures+are+checked+in+constant+time+over+the+body+as+sent%2C+which+drops+swop%2Fgithub-webhook+and+the+PSR-7+bridge.%5Cn%5CnBitbucket+takes+a+secret+%28BITBUCKET_SECRET%29%2C+checked+against+X-Hub-Signature%3B+without+one%2C+the+address+list+is+Atlassian%27s+current+one%2C+IPv6+included.+Azure+DevOps+looks+up+remoteUrl%2C+the+clone+URL%3A+3.x+read+url%2C+which+is+the+REST+API+URL%2C+so+no+real+delivery+could+match.+getCreatedTag%28%29+reads+Bitbucket%27s+and+Azure+DevOps%27+shapes+too.%5Cn%5CnUPGRADE-4.0.md+opens+with+the+steps+a+3.x+deployment+takes%2C+and+the+README+lists+each+provider%27s+endpoint+and+secret.+The+smoke+test+now+posts+to+the+github+and+bitbucket+endpoints+in+the+image%2C+and+136+tests+pass+in+Satisfy%27s+suite.+Deliveries+from+real+accounts+are+still+to+be+replayed%2C+which+needs+a+Gitea+account%2C+among+others.%22%2C%22timestamp%22%3A%222026-10-22T12%3A07%3A53-07%3A00%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FFivePaths%2Fsatisfy%2Fcommit%2F42d149814473826fd8087de5c0ad8b770a8654f2%22%2C%22author%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22Tyler+Brown+Cifu+Shuster%22%2C%22email%22%3A%22tyler%40fivepaths.com%22%2C%22date%22%3A%22202